            "markup": "\u003Ch2 class=\u0022govuk-heading-s\u0022 style=\u0022color: rgb(61, 61, 61); font-family: \u0027Open Sans\u0027, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-weight: bold; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; display: block; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\u0022\u003EFooter bar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp style=\u0022color: rgb(61, 61, 61); font-family: \u0027Open Sans\u0027, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-weight: 400; font-size: medium; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\u0022 class=\u0022govuk-body\u0022\u003EThe TPR footer bar is one component usually present at the bottom of pages across the site\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp style=\u0022color: rgb(61, 61, 61); font-family: \u0027Open Sans\u0027, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-weight: 400; font-size: medium; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\u0022 class=\u0022govuk-body\u0022\u003EIt supports localisation / culture variance and consists\u0026nbsp;of three areas:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul class=\u0022govuk-list govuk-list--bullet\u0022 style=\u0022font-family: \u0027Open Sans\u0027, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-weight: 400; font-size: medium; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(61, 61, 61); margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; padding-left: 20px; list-style-type: disc; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cli style=\u0022margin-bottom: 5px;\u0022\u003Ethe TPR logo\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli style=\u0022margin-bottom: 5px;\u0022\u003Elinks (optional)\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli style=\u0022margin-bottom: 5px;\u0022\u003Ea copyright statement\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp style=\u0022color: rgb(61, 61, 61); font-family: \u0027Open Sans\u0027, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-weight: 400; font-size: medium; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\u0022 class=\u0022govuk-body\u0022\u003EIt is possible for the logo not to be linked, as demonstrated in the second example.\u003C/p\u003E"
